Read these root files before making significant project changes:

@AGENTS.md
@PROJECT_RULES.md
@PROJECT_CONTEXT.md
@DEVELOPMENT_WORKFLOW.md
@IMPLEMENTATION_LOG.md
@MODEL_ROUTING_GUIDE.md

Core requirements:

- Keep the 3-day MVP scope unless the user explicitly requests V2.
- Use Groq as the default chat LLM provider.
- Use local embeddings for MVP unless changed by the user.
- Do not hardcode or commit secrets.
- Do not invent university policies or course rules.
- If source evidence is missing, say so clearly.
- Prefer small, verifiable implementation steps.
- Update `IMPLEMENTATION_LOG.md` after implementation or debugging sessions.
- Explain any new dependency before adding it.
- If a task fails verification, re-audit the smallest likely cause before broadening the change.
